.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Test\r\n  Name<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Results<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=120 valign=top style='width:90.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Unit<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=231 valign=top style='width:173.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Bio.\r\n  Ref. Interval<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.6pt'>\r\n  <td width=258 valign=top style='width:193.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=120 valign=top style='width:90.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=231 valign=top style='width:173.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.6pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <td width=258 valign=top style='width:193.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CEA,\r\n  Serum<\/span><\/b><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\n  <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=120 valign=top style='width:90.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ng\/mL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=231 valign=top style='width:173.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\r\n  0.00 \u2013 5.00<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <td width=258 valign=top style='width:193.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology\r\n  : ECLIA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=120 valign=top style='width:90.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=231 valign=top style='width:173.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:15.3pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>REFERENCE GROUP REFERENCE RANGE IN \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ng\/ML<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Non\r\nSmokers\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0&lt;3.00<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Smokers\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0&lt;5.00<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COMMENTS <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Carcinoembryonic\r\nantigen (CEA) is a protein that is present in certain tissues of a developing\r\nbaby (fetus). By the time a baby is born, it drops to a very low level. In\r\nadults, CEA is normally present at very low levels in the blood but may be\r\nelevated with certain types of cancer. This test measures the amount of CEA in\r\nthe blood to help evaluate individuals diagnosed with cancer. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Originally,\r\nit was thought that CEA was a specific marker for colon cancer, but further\r\nstudy has shown that an increase in CEA may be seen in a wide variety of other\r\ncancers. CEA can also be increased in some non-cancer-related conditions, such\r\nas inflammation, cirrhosis, peptic ulcer, ulcerative colitis, rectal polyps,\r\nemphysema, and benign breast disease, and in smokers. For this reason, it is\r\nnot useful as a general cancer screening tool, but it does have a role in\r\nevaluating response to cancer treatment. When an individual has been diagnosed\r\nwith cancer, an initial baseline test for CEA may be performed. If this level\r\nis elevated, then subsequent serial testing of CEA may be performed to monitor\r\nthe cancer as the individual undergoes treatment.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Note: <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1.\r\nThis test is not recommended for cancer screening in the general population. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2.\r\nFalse negative \/ positive results are observed in patients receiving mouse\r\nmonoclonal antibodies for diagnosis or therapy. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3.\r\nPatients with confirmed carcinoma may show normal pre-treatment CEA levels.\r\nHence this assay, regardless of level, should not be interpreted as absolute\r\nevidence for the presence or absence of malignant disease. The assay value\r\nshould be used in conjunction with findings from clinical evaluation and other\r\ndiagnostic procedures.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a04.\r\nPersistently elevated CEA levels are usually indicative of progressive\r\nmalignant disease and poor therapeutic response<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical Use <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u2022&nbsp;Monitoring&nbsp;patients&nbsp;with&nbsp;Colorectal,&nbsp;Gastrointestinal,&nbsp;Lung&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breast&nbsp;carcinoma\r\n\u2022&nbsp;Diagnosis&nbsp;of&nbsp;occult&nbsp;metastatic&nbsp;disease&nbsp;and&nbsp;\/&nbsp;or&nbsp;residual&nbsp;disease<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}